<title>AUSTRIA: Austria cenbank allots 13.7 bln ATS in repos.</title>
<headline>Austria cenbank allots 13.7 bln ATS in repos.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian National Bank said on Friday it had allotted 13.7 billion schillings in two-week securities repurchase agreements at a fixed rate of 3.0 percent, filling 11 percent of bids.</p>
<p>Last week, the central bank allocated 7.71 billion schillings in repos, also at three percent, filling six percent of bids. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 53112 274</p>
